  "observations": [
    "Owned/external, pending save, safe save/source errors, pinned state, backup-restored state and normally restarted pinned state show the actual UI outcomes.",
    "All six actual keyboard pin outlines and six safe errors are fully visible at 760 by 540. Explicit appearance preferences and reloads drive the real light/dark cases. At 125 and 150 percent long paths wrap; lower actions and later settings categories need vertical scrolling.",
    "The metadata-read-error image captures the top of the settings content; its error notice is below the captured viewport. Native assertions verify the actual error and recovery, but this image does not visually prove the notice. A corrected capture is being run separately.",
    "Actual moved-and-replaced Git directories show the unverified creation badge, disabled pin and safe retained-files explanation. The moved tree is separately listed below.",
    "This review does not accept current complete source, current distribution, snapshots/restoration, destructive cleanup or full reference parity."
  ],
  "scope": "Actual local worktree pin UI, strict full-window bridge, write/source/read failures, same-profile gzip restore separation, local restart and replaced-directory rejection. Quick Chat restrictions, cross-profile creation-authority transfer, snapshots, destructive cleanup, full reference parity and current distribution require separate evidence."
